# ~/.gitconfig 模板 (由 dotfiles 管理) — 双账号目录级身份
# 默认身份 = 个人 go2sun; ~/work/ 下自动切换为工作身份

[user]
	name = go2sun
	email = go2sun@gmail.com
[includeIf "gitdir:~/work/"]
	path = ~/.gitconfig-work
[credential]
	helper = osxkeychain
[init]
	defaultBranch = main
[filter "lfs"]
	required = true
	clean = git-lfs clean -- %f
	smudge = git-lfs smudge -- %f
	process = git-lfs filter-process
[http]
	postBuffer = 524288000
[safe]
	directory = *
